WEBVTT

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.583
"Love works in mysterious ways."

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:12.625
"It finds its way back to us."

00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:16.583
"In a new form, with a new smile."

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:23.375
"And this time,
she gave not only love but herself

00:00:24.292 --> 00:00:25.333
another chance."

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:32.542
"Sometimes, the greatest journey
is not the one

00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:37.333
that takes us to a new place,
but the one that leads us back

00:00:38.208 --> 00:00:39.250
to the love we once lost."

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:40.708
FIKAR
READING SESSION

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:44.458
Thank you.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:42.333
{\an8}Thanks.

00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:53.583
She's calling me, which means
you've been ignoring her calls.

00:01:58.583 --> 00:01:59.875
Yes, Mom.

00:02:01.292 --> 00:02:02.542
Yes, I understand.

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:08.167
No, but you've shown me
Dr. Gupta's daughter's profile before.

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:09.917
- Chander…
- Yes.

00:02:12.792 --> 00:02:14.375
<i>Now what's all this about?</i>

00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:17.208
<i>Look, if you like someone,</i>
<i>just tell me beforehand.</i>

00:02:17.292 --> 00:02:18.792
<i>It's a really good proposal, Chander.</i>

00:02:18.875 --> 00:02:20.250
<i>- Even the horoscopes have matched.</i>
- What?

00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:22.208
- Let's meet her.
<i>- She's very beautiful.</i>

00:02:22.292 --> 00:02:23.167
Are you mad?

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.875
<i>Lately, you've been</i>
<i>dismissing everything I tell you.</i>

00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:27.500
<i>Chander? Hello?</i>

00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:29.750
Yes, Mom?

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:32.333
Mom, I don't want to get married.
For now.

00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:35.375
So, please decline the proposal.

00:02:35.458 --> 00:02:39.042
And I'm very busy with work.
I'll call you back later.

00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:44.000
Have you turned into a rebel,
Mr. Software Engineer?

00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:47.625
What do you mean, "Let's meet her"?
Is this some kind of social experiment?

00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:48.625
No.

00:02:49.292 --> 00:02:52.250
- But, please, show me the profile once.
- No.

00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:56.250
- Okay, show me one photo.
- No! I know you very well.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.625
First, you'll see the photo,
then you'll judge the profile.

00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:03.667
Then you'll try to convince me
that I should definitely meet this girl.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.125
And you'll sit at the next table
in the cafe

00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:09.042
- and enjoy the whole drama for free. Why?
- No.

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:13.500
Didn't you get enough of playing this game
with poor Shalini Upadhyay ten days ago?

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:15.708
Well, Shalini Upadhyay was boring.

00:03:15.792 --> 00:03:17.333
Who told you that?

00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:24.167
I was just thinking that maybe
Gupta <i>ji's</i> daughter

00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:28.000
could be the perfect daughter-in-law
for your mother.

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:29.542
No?

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.958
Hey, my phone!
Give my phone back!

00:03:34.042 --> 00:03:35.583
- Give me my phone!
- Chander, please!

00:03:35.667 --> 00:03:36.792
- One photo! One photo!
- No!

00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:39.875
Just trying to help my good friend
meet the girl of his dreams!

00:03:39.958 --> 00:03:41.208
Really?

00:03:41.292 --> 00:03:43.250
I don't need your help.

00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:45.500
Are you upset?

00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:48.125
I was just joking.

00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:49.125
I know.

00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:54.417
And I don't think
I need to meet anyone anymore.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.375
Why? Have you found someone else?

00:03:57.208 --> 00:03:58.417
You could say that.

00:04:00.542 --> 00:04:02.042
Who is this angel?

00:04:02.583 --> 00:04:05.250
The very same girl
who's taken over my house.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.750
She makes popcorn in my kitchen.

00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:11.917
She has decorated my house
with wind chimes.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.500
She wears my clothes.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.958
And she has turned my clean, tidy house
into a full-blown bachelor pad.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:19.667
Excuse me!

00:04:20.167 --> 00:04:22.250
What are you trying to say?
That I'm messy?

00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:24.958
I've heard that even the moon
isn't without blemishes.

00:04:26.042 --> 00:04:27.458
Oh, Chander!

00:04:27.542 --> 00:04:29.833
You've become so dramatic!

00:04:29.917 --> 00:04:33.208
And by the way,
I have never worn your clothes.

00:04:33.292 --> 00:04:36.000
- Objection, milord!
- It's not "milord."

00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:38.000
Whatever it is. This is my T-shirt.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.583
This one's an exception.

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:42.583
It's comfortable.

00:04:43.208 --> 00:04:44.458
Sustained!

00:04:51.125 --> 00:04:52.031
<i>Bhaiya!</i>

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:55.625
<i>Didi's </i>lunchbox is ready,
and so is yours. Okay?

00:04:55.708 --> 00:04:58.292
- I'll come in the evening.
<i>- Didi, </i>listen!

00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:01.958
Has anyone asked anything yet?

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:06.417
- Yes, someone did.
- Who?

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.667
Aunty Tyagi.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.875
- What did you say?
- I told her she's your paternal cousin.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.333
- I did the right thing, didn't I?
- She believed you?

00:05:14.417 --> 00:05:16.833
- I didn't ask her that. Should I ask her?
- No!

00:05:18.667 --> 00:05:20.083
No. Thank you.

00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:29.292
- Shall we go?
- Listen.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.083
Should we mass bunk today?

00:05:32.167 --> 00:05:33.250
Why?

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:36.167
- No particular reason. Just like that.
- Just like that?

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.375
Hey, I can be spontaneous too!

00:05:40.125 --> 00:05:42.625
No. I have to go today.

00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:44.750
Today is the final hearing
of the Arora vs. Arora case.

00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:48.083
And since the Mumbai team is here
only until today, I have to go.

00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:51.167
You should bond
with your future teammates.

00:05:52.042 --> 00:05:52.958
Cool.

00:05:54.875 --> 00:05:57.792
Actually, that plan

00:05:57.875 --> 00:05:59.667
is temporarily suspended.

00:06:02.625 --> 00:06:03.500
Seriously?

00:06:05.625 --> 00:06:06.667
Yes.

00:06:09.833 --> 00:06:10.750
Okay!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:15.542
Okay, so today's mass bunk is canceled.
But I'll pick you up at 5:00 p.m.

00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:16.500
Done.

00:06:16.583 --> 00:06:17.542
Okay, bye.

00:06:19.458 --> 00:06:21.333
- I'll see you.
- Lunchbox!

00:06:21.417 --> 00:06:22.292
Yeah.

00:06:26.292 --> 00:06:27.417
Thank you.

00:06:32.872 --> 00:06:38.331
MOM: PRIYANKA IS A VERY NICE GIRL.
MEET HER ONCE

00:06:38.625 --> 00:06:39.750
Mom!

00:06:40.667 --> 00:06:43.792
Yes, it's a bit foggy right now,
but it should clear up in an hour.

00:06:43.875 --> 00:06:46.542
Then you'll be able to see
the mountain behind as well.

00:06:46.625 --> 00:06:47.958
<i>So beautiful.</i>

00:06:48.042 --> 00:06:50.542
<i>I really feel like revisiting that place.</i>

00:06:50.625 --> 00:06:54.333
<i>You know, seeing you there gives me peace.</i>

00:06:54.417 --> 00:06:57.292
<i>But, please,</i>
<i>come home this Diwali, Chander.</i>

00:06:59.542 --> 00:07:00.792
I'll think about it, Mom.

00:07:02.417 --> 00:07:04.667
It's peak season for travel,
so coming over might be tough.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.167
<i>Come home with Preeti at least once.</i>

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.875
<i>Your dad can also meet her.</i>

00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:12.708
What will happen
if I introduce her to Dad?

00:07:14.792 --> 00:07:16.333
He's fine on his side,

00:07:16.417 --> 00:07:17.875
and I'm fine on mine.

00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:19.958
Then he'll keep pestering me,
"Get married! Get married!"

00:07:20.042 --> 00:07:22.042
<i>It's not like that, Chander.</i>

00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:24.250
Okay, take care of yourself.
I'll call you later.

00:07:24.333 --> 00:07:25.500
<i>- Okay.</i>
- Bye.

00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:26.583
<i>Bye.</i>

00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:36.208
Thanks.

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:45.708
Can I ask you something?

00:07:45.792 --> 00:07:47.458
Is it about Chander?

00:07:48.917 --> 00:07:52.083
Yes, but it's about you as well.

00:07:52.167 --> 00:07:53.125
Okay.

00:07:54.167 --> 00:07:55.250
During the reading today,

00:07:55.333 --> 00:07:57.647
he looked as though he was
reminiscing about someone else.

00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:02.000
Then I looked at you.

00:08:02.875 --> 00:08:04.000
And what did you see?

00:08:06.042 --> 00:08:07.042
Acceptance.

00:08:08.542 --> 00:08:10.542
Which is beautiful, but…

00:08:11.792 --> 00:08:15.500
Today, I saw something on your face
that I'd never seen before.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:16.875
What?

00:08:18.042 --> 00:08:19.000
A longing.

00:08:25.917 --> 00:08:27.917
There was someone Chander loved deeply,

00:08:28.542 --> 00:08:30.458
and I don't want to replace her.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.000
Because if she hadn't been in his life,

00:08:35.625 --> 00:08:37.375
maybe we wouldn't be here today.

00:08:39.167 --> 00:08:40.333
And what about you?

00:08:41.917 --> 00:08:43.708
There's no brokenness there.

00:08:43.792 --> 00:08:46.083
I don't have a tragic love story.

00:08:46.583 --> 00:08:50.083
And my relationship with my parents
is completely safe.

00:08:50.167 --> 00:08:52.875
So, I'm sorry, sir,
there's no story there for you.

00:08:52.958 --> 00:08:54.625
I've already found my story.

00:08:54.708 --> 00:08:56.856
If you write about me,
I'm taking all the royalties.

00:08:59.917 --> 00:09:01.375
Well, what's your story?

00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:03.792
Me? My story?

00:09:04.542 --> 00:09:05.458
- Oh!
- Yeah.

00:09:05.958 --> 00:09:07.956
I have written my story in my books.

00:09:09.125 --> 00:09:10.681
Maybe that's the truth
that reaches people.

00:09:12.222 --> 00:09:14.222
But do you know
the hardest part about being a writer?

00:09:15.042 --> 00:09:16.542
I can't read my own books.

00:09:17.397 --> 00:09:19.147
You could've read them
if your writing had been better.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:21.417
Oh!

00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:31.292
The other reason is that maybe
I don't want to face my mistakes again.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.125
But why?

00:09:33.792 --> 00:09:37.750
As a fan, I have to tell you that
all your mistakes are beautiful.

00:09:40.917 --> 00:09:42.000
Preeti?

00:09:44.958 --> 00:09:49.792
If someone else already lives in
Chander's eyes, then why are you with him?

00:09:56.292 --> 00:10:01.042
Where does it say that loving two people
at different stages of life is wrong?

00:10:03.292 --> 00:10:06.917
I think we can't unlove someone
we have deeply loved once.

00:10:09.375 --> 00:10:11.042
It's a nice thought.

00:10:11.667 --> 00:10:15.208
But the reality of facing that crossroad,

00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:17.375
can be hard.

00:10:29.083 --> 00:10:32.625
Chander, your performance in
the last quarter has been most impressive.

00:10:32.708 --> 00:10:34.000
Thank you, sir.

00:10:34.539 --> 00:10:36.422
A new role is opening up in Delhi.

00:10:36.858 --> 00:10:38.272
And I think you're the perfect fit.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.122
You can join next month.

00:10:42.667 --> 00:10:43.625
Delhi?

00:10:46.542 --> 00:10:48.875
Okay. I'll think about it, sir.

00:10:48.958 --> 00:10:51.583
What's there to think about?
You can stay with your family.

00:10:51.667 --> 00:10:54.125
I know, sir.
But, please, give me some time.

00:10:54.664 --> 00:10:56.833
- Okay. Think about it.
- Yes.

00:10:57.292 --> 00:10:58.347
Thank you.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.000
<i>I'm sorry, Anu </i>ji.

00:11:04.083 --> 00:11:06.292
It's okay, Sudha.
But you know what?

00:11:06.792 --> 00:11:08.056
It's been 30 years since we got married,

00:11:08.583 --> 00:11:10.556
but I'm still not able
to understand Prakash.

00:11:12.958 --> 00:11:14.625
Why did you wait so many years?

00:11:15.542 --> 00:11:18.000
<i>I never realized how deeply</i>
<i>I'd been manipulated.</i>

00:11:19.125 --> 00:11:21.000
I didn't have financial independence.

00:11:21.583 --> 00:11:22.989
And my parents had passed away.

00:11:23.508 --> 00:11:26.064
Then the kids said,
"Mom, how will you live without Dad?"

00:11:27.164 --> 00:11:28.417
"What will people say?"

00:11:29.708 --> 00:11:31.464
To him, I existed only to fulfil duties.

00:11:32.458 --> 00:11:34.314
Cook, manage the house,
take care of the children.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.381
And ignore his affairs.

00:11:40.542 --> 00:11:43.458
Today, even though I'm divorced, I'm free.

00:11:45.833 --> 00:11:48.333
And for the first time in many years,

00:11:49.667 --> 00:11:50.708
I feel alive.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.667
Take care of yourself, okay?

00:11:59.083 --> 00:12:00.750
Call me if you need anything.

00:12:08.917 --> 00:12:10.292
Case number 17!

00:12:21.208 --> 00:12:23.083
Hello, boss lady! How are you?

00:12:23.667 --> 00:12:26.167
Chutki,<i> what have you thought</i>
<i>about Mumbai?</i>

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.847
Yes, that…

00:12:28.458 --> 00:12:31.417
Some important cases are ongoing here,
so after that.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:32.750
{\an8}<i>Will they wait that long?</i>

00:12:33.417 --> 00:12:35.292
If they don't, I'll find something else.

00:12:35.375 --> 00:12:36.375
<i>Think about it.</i>

00:12:36.458 --> 00:12:38.458
<i>If they're paying well, then go for it.</i>

00:12:38.542 --> 00:12:40.125
What kind of mother are you?

00:12:40.708 --> 00:12:42.397
Sending your daughter away from yourself!

00:12:43.167 --> 00:12:44.833
{\an8}<i>I'm setting my daughter free.</i>

00:12:44.917 --> 00:12:46.833
<i>You know your dad's family, right?</i>

00:12:46.917 --> 00:12:49.333
{\an8}<i>They'll start chasing you</i>
<i>with proposals again!</i>

00:12:50.792 --> 00:12:52.542
You're the best boss lady!

00:12:52.625 --> 00:12:54.042
{\an8}<i>You look happy.</i>

00:12:54.583 --> 00:12:58.792
{\an8}<i>Okay, tell me,</i>
<i>how's your new flatmate, Chanda?</i>

00:12:59.542 --> 00:13:00.458
Yeah…

00:13:01.417 --> 00:13:02.375
She's great.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.250
Mom, I'm hanging up, okay?
I'm running late.

00:13:05.333 --> 00:13:06.208
<i>Listen!</i>

00:13:07.583 --> 00:13:08.542
{\an8}<i>Stay happy.</i>

00:13:10.667 --> 00:13:11.625
I love you, Mom.

00:13:12.333 --> 00:13:13.208
Bye.

00:13:15.333 --> 00:13:16.250
Chanda.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:21.500
"Some unspoken, hazy reflections
become tangled in memory."

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:24.875
"They neither fade nor deepen."

00:13:24.958 --> 00:13:27.833
"They simply seep into
the fabric of existence,

00:13:27.917 --> 00:13:30.667
like water stains
that never truly disappear."

00:13:32.125 --> 00:13:33.000
Kamleshwar.

00:13:34.375 --> 00:13:35.250
Yes!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:41.417
What do you think? Do stories end?
Or do they just pause?

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.625
I believe that stories never end.

00:13:45.708 --> 00:13:48.292
Some characters in the story change,

00:13:49.042 --> 00:13:51.208
some settings change.

00:13:52.958 --> 00:13:54.833
But the story always continues.

00:13:54.917 --> 00:13:56.375
Are you a philosopher too?

00:13:56.458 --> 00:13:58.917
No, ma'am, I'm just a hopeful person.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.417
Who gets lost in books a little too much.

00:14:02.708 --> 00:14:03.708
Maybe.

00:14:04.583 --> 00:14:07.292
Okay, tell me.
Which is your favorite book?

00:14:07.375 --> 00:14:08.875
There are many.

00:14:08.958 --> 00:14:11.375
- Which is your favorite among them?
- Among these?

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:16.542
Okay. Not non-fiction.

00:14:16.625 --> 00:14:18.875
In fiction…

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.792
Yes!

00:14:23.208 --> 00:14:24.750
<i>Pride and Prejudice!</i>

00:14:25.375 --> 00:14:27.917
An extremely handsome boy,

00:14:28.625 --> 00:14:32.125
and a beautiful, educated,
but outspoken girl

00:14:33.375 --> 00:14:35.500
like each other.

00:14:35.583 --> 00:14:39.958
But they can't be together
until they understand themselves.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.875
You're very romantic, Chander!

00:14:45.958 --> 00:14:47.250
Did you read the book or watch the movie?

00:14:47.958 --> 00:14:48.875
What do you think?

00:14:49.875 --> 00:14:50.833
Not bad.

00:14:53.097 --> 00:14:54.417
Now it's your turn.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.458
{\an8}<i>Metamorphosis. </i>Kafka.

00:15:03.208 --> 00:15:04.167
{\an8}It was my dad's favorite.

00:15:08.167 --> 00:15:09.417
I haven't read it.

00:15:10.292 --> 00:15:11.917
So, I just want to remember this moment.

00:15:18.792 --> 00:15:19.833
Okay.

00:15:24.917 --> 00:15:26.339
You want to remember only this moment?

00:15:28.331 --> 00:15:29.458
No, there are many.

00:15:30.208 --> 00:15:31.333
Like?

00:15:33.958 --> 00:15:35.375
Like…

00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:38.208
when we first met at the cafe,
and you rejected me.

00:15:41.708 --> 00:15:42.667
And?

00:15:45.292 --> 00:15:48.750
And when you called me
suddenly at 2:00 a.m.

00:15:50.542 --> 00:15:51.458
And?

00:15:54.333 --> 00:15:55.333
And…

00:15:56.000 --> 00:16:00.458
that morning when we first kissed.

00:16:00.542 --> 00:16:01.542
Kissed.

00:16:02.667 --> 00:16:03.625
And?

00:16:04.833 --> 00:16:05.750
And…

00:16:06.917 --> 00:16:10.417
I can't remember anything else, Sudha.
People are watching. Please.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.042
- So?
- So… dinner!

00:16:14.292 --> 00:16:15.208
Yes.

00:16:15.875 --> 00:16:16.750
No.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.333
- Let's go from here.
- Where?

00:16:21.167 --> 00:16:26.500
To the place you promised you'd never go.

00:16:29.375 --> 00:16:30.708
But first, beat me.

00:16:30.792 --> 00:16:31.792
Okay.

00:17:44.833 --> 00:17:48.000
<i>Your dreams are the reason we're together</i>

00:17:48.083 --> 00:17:51.125
<i>Finding each other night after night</i>

00:17:53.542 --> 00:17:56.792
<i>Even awake, I'm lost in your spell</i>

00:17:56.875 --> 00:18:00.250
<i>Together, we've drifted beyond the clouds</i>

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:06.833
<i>Your eyes have left their mark</i>
<i>Upon my heart</i>

00:18:06.917 --> 00:18:10.333
<i>You're the only love I've ever known</i>

00:18:11.042 --> 00:18:15.625
<i>I live each moment wrapped in your love</i>

00:18:15.708 --> 00:18:19.208
<i>A blessing gifted by the hands of God</i>

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:24.375
<i>In finding you, I found my answer true</i>

00:18:24.458 --> 00:18:27.833
<i>You are the question</i>
<i>God once placed in my heart</i>

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:33.042
<i>You're the blessing</i>
<i>My prayers have brought to me</i>

00:18:33.125 --> 00:18:37.208
<i>Stay close to my heart and never leave</i>

00:19:07.375 --> 00:19:08.292
Preeti?

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.167
Preeti?

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:42.917
You okay?

00:19:44.958 --> 00:19:47.375
- Yeah.
- What are you thinking?

00:19:49.875 --> 00:19:50.875
Should I be honest or not?

00:19:56.875 --> 00:19:58.625
I haven't felt this way in a long time.

00:19:59.639 --> 00:20:01.042
And listen,
I don't wanna make this uncomfortable

00:20:01.125 --> 00:20:03.333
- for you--
- Preet. I'm here.

00:20:03.417 --> 00:20:04.417
Tell me.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:11.208
What if, someday,
you unexpectedly meet Sudha?

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:17.625
What?

00:20:19.939 --> 00:20:21.339
Why this question all of a sudden?

00:20:23.167 --> 00:20:25.417
This has been on my mind for a while now.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:26.792
I just couldn't say it.

00:20:27.708 --> 00:20:28.964
I don't know what happened today.

00:20:29.189 --> 00:20:32.375
And then I was like,
no secrets between partners, right?

00:20:33.042 --> 00:20:34.250
No secrets. Ever.

00:20:39.542 --> 00:20:41.833
That story ended long ago, Preet.

00:20:45.875 --> 00:20:47.583
You know, I read somewhere…

00:20:49.547 --> 00:20:53.439
that every cell in the human body gets
completely replaced every seven years.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.333
- What?
- Yeah.

00:20:57.042 --> 00:20:59.292
Doesn't sound fully scientific to me.

00:20:59.375 --> 00:21:01.539
See! At least it made you laugh!

00:21:04.375 --> 00:21:06.208
So, according to this unscientific theory,

00:21:06.292 --> 00:21:10.397
you and I are no longer the people
we were seven years ago.

00:21:13.625 --> 00:21:14.939
So…

00:21:17.417 --> 00:21:18.458
Come here.

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:29.042
It's cold!

00:21:42.625 --> 00:21:43.708
Sudha…

00:21:46.625 --> 00:21:48.167
- I think I'm falling--
- I know.

00:21:52.917 --> 00:21:54.167
What even are you?

00:21:58.625 --> 00:22:01.000
An unforgettable life experience.

00:22:01.083 --> 00:22:03.000
One hundred percent.

00:22:08.792 --> 00:22:11.292
- Do you see that up there?
- Where?

00:22:11.375 --> 00:22:13.292
- The seven stars you see…
- Yeah?

00:22:14.292 --> 00:22:15.667
…are called the Great Bear.

00:22:19.417 --> 00:22:22.458
After eating your pasta,
I'm feeling like the great bear!

00:22:23.125 --> 00:22:24.208
No, really. Look.

00:22:34.833 --> 00:22:36.250
This is perfect, Chander.

00:22:38.333 --> 00:22:41.542
What could possibly be better than this
after getting married?

00:22:41.625 --> 00:22:42.625
Name one thing.

00:22:46.708 --> 00:22:47.583
Honeymoon.

00:22:48.917 --> 00:22:49.792
Yeah, honeymoon.

00:22:50.667 --> 00:22:53.875
Because you can't have a honeymoon
without getting married.

00:22:54.875 --> 00:22:55.917
Why not?

00:22:57.083 --> 00:22:58.792
Let's go on our honeymoon.

00:22:58.875 --> 00:23:00.250
Yeah, right!

00:23:00.750 --> 00:23:03.458
No, really!
Tell me, where do you want to go?

00:23:03.542 --> 00:23:04.667
I'll search online.

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:07.625
We'll pick whichever place
has the cheapest package, okay?

00:23:07.708 --> 00:23:08.750
Are you serious?

00:23:09.958 --> 00:23:11.083
You're strange!

00:23:11.625 --> 00:23:13.417
Here, a girl is inviting you
on a honeymoon,

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:16.125
and you're acting like a newlywed bride!

00:23:19.292 --> 00:23:20.292
Look at this.

00:23:20.375 --> 00:23:23.625
There's an "amazing" Andaman package
available at a 40-percent discount.

00:23:23.708 --> 00:23:25.250
- Really?
- Forty percent!

00:23:25.333 --> 00:23:26.375
Wow!

00:23:26.958 --> 00:23:28.333
How many days is it for?

00:23:28.417 --> 00:23:29.931
Why do you care about the days?

00:23:30.181 --> 00:23:31.792
It's for seven whole nights.

00:23:37.792 --> 00:23:39.542
Everything is a joke to you, isn't it?

00:23:39.625 --> 00:23:41.417
Life is also a joke.

00:23:42.625 --> 00:23:46.625
The more seriously you take life,
the more seriously life takes you.

00:23:51.167 --> 00:23:52.958
Done! It's done.

00:23:53.042 --> 00:23:55.125
The package is booked and non-refundable,

00:23:55.208 --> 00:23:56.625
so now we have to go!

00:23:56.708 --> 00:23:57.667
Wait a minute!

00:23:58.417 --> 00:24:00.000
- Really?
- Yes.

00:24:00.583 --> 00:24:01.625
When do we have to leave?

00:24:01.708 --> 00:24:03.667
Saturday evening.
So, take five days off, okay?

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:04.625
So soon?

00:24:04.708 --> 00:24:07.542
So, should we wait for your wedding
to go on a honeymoon?

00:24:07.625 --> 00:24:09.500
This one was available at a discount.

00:24:12.083 --> 00:24:13.292
Sudha!

00:24:13.375 --> 00:24:15.917
Come on! We have
so much preparation to do now!

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:19.000
What preparation?
We just have to pack.

00:24:19.583 --> 00:24:20.972
We also have to find a henna artist.

00:24:22.083 --> 00:24:24.333
We should still have that
wedding vibe on our honeymoon.

00:24:24.417 --> 00:24:27.583
Who will you find at this hour
of the night? Come here.

00:24:31.875 --> 00:24:34.000
Did you really book the package?

00:24:35.375 --> 00:24:36.375
You are crazy!

00:24:40.500 --> 00:24:41.875
What will happen to us?

00:24:43.708 --> 00:24:45.458
Whatever has to happen will happen.

00:24:46.667 --> 00:24:48.542
Right now, there is only this moment.

00:24:50.167 --> 00:24:52.208
You, me…

00:24:54.417 --> 00:24:55.542
and the Great Bear.

00:25:05.247 --> 00:25:10.042
{\an8}MOM: I'M COMING TOMORROW MORNING
BY BHOPAL EXPRESS. I WILL ARRIVE BY 6:30

00:27:37.833 --> 00:27:39.833
Subtitle translation by: Neha Nair


